      "rationale": "La clave de conflicto es (dependencyId, kind). Si ya existía, newConflicts = [].",
      "input": { "previousConflicts": [{ "dependencyId": "d1", "kind": "MANUAL" }], "tasks": [{ "id": "A", "kind": "task", "durationDays": 2 }, { "id": "B", "kind": "task", "durationDays": 2, "scheduleMode": "manual", "fixedStart": "2026-12-01" }],
        "dependencies": [{ "id": "d1", "predecessorId": "A", "successorId": "B", "type": "FS", "lagDays": 0 }] },
      "expected": { "outcome": "ok", "newConflicts": [] },
      "computedBy": "agente (a mano)", "reviewedBy": "responsable técnico (aprobación de AP-004, 2026-11-25)"
    },
    {
      "id": "C3-03", "title": "Predecesora completada con fechas reales: la sucesora parte de los hechos", "refs": ["G-C3-03"],
      "rationale": "A completada 11-30..12-02 (3 días reales frente a 2 planificados): s=B(11-30)=0, f=Bend(12-02)=3. B FS: s3 (jueves) f5. T = máx f no completadas = 5. A excluida del CPM.",
      "input": { "today": "2026-12-03", "tasks": [{ "id": "A", "kind": "task", "durationDays": 2, "status": "completada", "actualStart": "2026-11-30", "actualFinish": "2026-12-02" }, { "id": "B", "kind": "task", "durationDays": 2 }],
        "dependencies": [{ "id": "d1", "predecessorId": "A", "successorId": "B", "type": "FS", "lagDays": 0 }] },
      "expected": { "outcome": "ok", "projectFinishIdx": 5, "conflicts": [], "warnings": [],
        "tasks": { "A": { "class": "FACT_DONE", "startIdx": 0, "finishIdx": 3, "start": "2026-11-30", "finish": "2026-12-02", "totalFloat": null, "critical": false },
