      "rationale": "A d3 f3 (no iniciada). B en curso desde 12-01 (s1) d2 → f3. FS exige sB ≥ 3; real 1 → FACT déficit 2. Las cotas de inicio hacia FACT_RUNNING no se propagan hacia atrás: A LS = 3−3 = 0. START_OVERDUE de A (hoy 12-01 > 11-30).",
      "input": { "today": "2026-12-01", "tasks": [{ "id": "A", "kind": "task", "durationDays": 3 }, { "id": "B", "kind": "task", "durationDays": 2, "status": "en_curso", "actualStart": "2026-12-01" }],
        "dependencies": [{ "id": "d1", "predecessorId": "A", "successorId": "B", "type": "FS", "lagDays": 0 }] },
